<?php /** @var list<array<string,mixed>> $rows */ /** @var int $total */ /** @var int $page */ /** @var int $perPage */ /** @var array<string,mixed> $filters */ /** @var array<string,mixed> $qs */ /** @var array<string,int> $dash */ use Vertex\Core\View;
$sel = static fn (string $a, string $b): string => $a === $b ? ' selected' : ''; ?>
<div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Referral partners</p><h1>Payout requests</h1></div><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/referrals/dashboard">Dashboard</a></div>
<div class="stat-grid"><a class="stat" href="/payouts?status=requested"><span class="stat-n"><?= (int) ($dash['awaiting_review'] ?? 0) ?></span><span class="stat-l">Awaiting review</span></a><a class="stat" href="/payouts?status=approved"><span class="stat-n"><?= (int) ($dash['awaiting_payment'] ?? 0) ?></span><span class="stat-l">Approved, not yet paid</span></a>
    <a class="stat" href="/payouts?status=paid"><span class="stat-n"><?= (int) ($dash['paid_count'] ?? 0) ?></span><span class="stat-l">Paid</span></a><div class="stat"><span class="stat-n"><?= e(money($dash['paid_minor'] ?? 0)) ?></span><span class="stat-l">Total paid</span></div></div>
<form method="get" action="/payouts" class="toolbar" role="search"><div class="field"><label for="q">Search</label><input id="q" name="q" type="search" maxlength="100" placeholder="Reference, partner, payment reference" value="<?= e($filters['q']) ?>"></div>
    <div class="field"><label for="s">Status</label><select id="s" name="status"><option value="">All</option><?php foreach (config('referrals.payout_statuses') as $c => $l) : ?><option value="<?= e($c) ?>"<?= $sel($filters['status'], $c) ?>><?= e($l) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></div>
    <div class="field"><label for="from">From</label><input id="from" name="from" type="date" value="<?= e($filters['from']) ?>"></div><div class="field"><label for="to">To</label><input id="to" name="to" type="date" value="<?= e($filters['to']) ?>"></div><div class="field"><button class="btn btn-ghost" type="submit">Filter</button></div></form>
<div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Request</th><th>Partner</th><th class="num">Amount</th><th>Status</th><th>Requested</th><th>Paid</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <?php foreach ($rows as $p) : ?><tr><td><a href="/payouts/<?= e($p['public_id']) ?>"><strong><?= e($p['reference']) ?></strong></a></td><td><?= e($p['partner_name']) ?></td><td class="num"><?= e(money($p['amount_minor'])) ?></td><td><?= View::partial('pbadge', ['kind' => 'payout', 's' => $p['status']]) ?></td><td><?= e(local_time($p['requested_at'], 'd M Y')) ?></td><td><?= $p['paid_at'] ? e(local_time($p['paid_at'], 'd M Y')) : '—' ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?>
    <?php if ($rows === []) : ?><tr><td colspan="6" class="muted">No payout requests match.</td></tr><?php endif; ?></tbody></table></div>
<?= View::partial('pagination', ['page' => $page, 'perPage' => $perPage, 'total' => $total, 'filters' => $qs]) ?>
